Here are the MSTest attributes and patterns for each scenario:

### 1. Windows-only tests (MSTest 3.10+)

```csharp
[TestMethod]
[OSCondition(OperatingSystems.Windows)]
public void WindowsRegistry_ReadsValue()
{
    // Automatically skipped on Linux/macOS
}
```

### 2. Skip in CI (MSTest 3.10+)

```csharp
[TestMethod]
[CICondition(ConditionMode.Exclude)]
public void GpuTest_RequiresLocalHardware()
{
    // Skipped when CI environment variables are detected
}
```

### 3. Flaky external API — retry (MSTest 3.9+)

```csharp
[TestMethod]
[Retry(3)]
[Timeout(10000)]
public async Task WeatherApi_ReturnsForecast()
{
    var result = await _client.GetForecastAsync(_testContext.CancellationToken);
    Assert.IsNotNull(result);
}
```

Use `[Retry]` only for genuinely flaky external dependencies, not to mask race conditions.

### 4. Cleanup even on failure — `[TestCleanup]`

```csharp
[TestClass]
public sealed class TempFileTests
{
    private readonly TestContext _testContext;
    private string? _tempFilePath;

    public TempFileTests(TestContext testContext)
    {
        _testContext = testContext;
    }

    [TestInitialize]
    public void Setup()
    {
        _tempFilePath = Path.GetTempFileName();
    }

    [TestMethod]
    public void ProcessFile_WritesExpectedContent()
    {
        File.WriteAllText(_tempFilePath!, "test data");
        var result = FileProcessor.Process(_tempFilePath!);
        Assert.AreEqual("processed", result);
    }

    [TestCleanup]
    public void Cleanup()
    {
        // Runs even if the test fails
        if (_tempFilePath is not null && File.Exists(_tempFilePath))
        {
            File.Delete(_tempFilePath);
        }
    }
}
```

Alternatively, implement `IDisposable` — MSTest calls `Dispose` after each test (after `[TestCleanup]`).

### Combining them

You can stack these attributes:

```csharp
[TestMethod]
[OSCondition(OperatingSystems.Windows)]
[CICondition(ConditionMode.Exclude)]
[Retry(3)]
[Timeout(5000)]
public async Task WindowsGpuWeatherTest()
{
    // Windows-only, skipped in CI, retries up to 3 times
}
```

> **Requires**: MSTest **3.10+** for `[OSCondition]`/`[CICondition]`, **3.9+** for `[Retry]`. Use the `MSTest` metapackage or `MSTest.Sdk` at version `3.10.0` or later.
